c-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f1/42/default-avatar-2020-20.jpg", "contribution_count": 2, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-02-25", "published_at_date": "2020-02-25"}, {"review_id": 747428812, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r747428812-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "wow . . just wow . .", "text": "An eye opener. .  I went Saturday the day after 1.3m people went for the festival. \nThis place is eye opening, aside from the heavy waft of weed, the Babas in their (very) small loincloths, the creepy foreigners who never went home and of course the cremations at the waters edge, this place had everything for your camera lens to aim at. .  A truly inspiring place. . Dirty and dusty ? Oh yes, definitely, but you expect that, and everyone spitting on the floor. . Welcome to Nepal .  amazing place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2020-02-29"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "72D53A606A3BEF5A06E0DA3029F2BBE6", "name": "Sid", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Sid989", "username": "Sid989", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/02/5e/a1/f1/dave-b.jpg", "contribution_count": 229, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 294217, "location_name": "Hong Kong", "location_name_detailed": "Hong Kong, China"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-02-25", "published_at_date": "2020-02-25"}, {"review_id": 747273046, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r747273046-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath temple darsan ", "text": "Feb 23 and feb 24 2020 I went to Pashupatinath.  \n\nBest time to visit temple is early morning. \nThere was no rush and I had enough time to pray and do Darshan. \n\nWeather was very cold in the morning. \nTemple open 5Am. \nI didn’t able to make it at 5 am. \nBut at 5:45Am was also it’s safe around the temple. \n\nEvening after 5:30Pm there is little rush lot more is going on. \n\nEvening arti at the gath right behind the Pashupatinath temple. \nArti start at 7pm. \n\nLive cremation also is going on all day long That’s not my Favourite place to be .\n\nIf you want to avoid live cremation you could by not going the back side of the temple where the gatth ( small dirty river ) is. \n\nStayed at a hotel kailesh KUTI Inn very close to temple 1 min walk.  \n\nFood and hospitality was good.  \n\nI have posted separate review about the hotel. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2020-02-29"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "988D9C38F14B66096834B7BBB822ECE1", "name": "rajussf", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/rajussf", "username": "rajussf", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e7/7b/default-avatar-2020-56.jpg", "contribution_count": 56, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 60713, "location_name": "San Francisco", "location_name_detailed": "San Francisco, California"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/fe/50/ea/photo1jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/fe/50/eb/photo2jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/fe/50/ec/photo3jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/fe/50/ed/photo4jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/fe/50/ee/photo5jpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2020-02-24", "published_at_date": "2020-02-24"}, {"review_id": 7